    "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br />For least positive value, when <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N,</mi></math> two of them are <math><mn>1</mn></math> and one of them is <math><mn>2</mn></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
